sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Controller
    participant Service
    participant Database as Database (Prisna)

    Client->>Controller: POST /login (email, password)
    
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi format input
    
    Controller->>Service: autentikasi(email, password)
    
    Service->>Database: SELECT * FROM pengguna WHERE email = ?
    Database-->>Service: Return pengguna (termasuk password/hash)
    
    Service->>Service: Split hash -> (algorithm, salt, expectedKey)
    Service->>Service: scrypt(password, salt) -> actualKey
    Service->>Service: timingSafeEqual(actualKey, expectedKey)?
    
    alt [Cocok]
        Service-->>Controller: Return ProfilPublik
        Controller-->>Client: 200 OK (JSON Profil)
    else [Tidak Cocok]
        Service-->>Controller: Return null
        Controller-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized ("Email atau password tidak sesuai")
    end